<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed mixed in heavy trading Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 16.03 to 6020.81, a record.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 0.93 to 374.53.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.10.</p>
<p>Losers beat gainers 1212 to 1124.</p>
<p>Volume was 441,396,330, compared with 458,871,070 Tuesday.</p>
